[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们为了调查，来到了食堂。|#0101Adv31_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:发生了这种事，实在是没食欲。|#0101Adv31_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些饭菜是不是一直都没换过新的啊？|#0101Adv31_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再怎么样，至少还是会定期换饭菜的吧……？|#0101Adv31_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对放在取餐处的饭菜，<br>三人各自说道。|#0101Adv31_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是那个看守换的饭菜吧。<br>我们进不了厨房，所以煮饭也是看守负责的咯？|#0101Adv31_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说，可不可以不要勾起别人的想像？<br>你害我以后都吃不下饭了欸。|#0101Adv31_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:三人原地散开，<br>开始大致搜索一遍食堂。|#0101Adv31_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

