[PrintTextModified Text:凶手为什么会想要<br>杀死诺亚呢。|#0101Adv31_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在调查餐桌下时，<br>雪莉忽然抛来了问题。|#0101Adv31_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚她<br>究竟是个怎样的人呢？|#0101Adv31_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

